# `.claude/*` and not `.claude/`, so the negations below can work. Git will not
# descend into an excluded DIRECTORY, so `!.claude/skills/` under a bare
# `.claude/` re-includes nothing — the same trap as the `*token*` line above.
# Local state (settings.local.json, transcripts, scratch) stays ignored; the
# checked-in design system does not.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

